The below is attributable to Principal Deputy Spokesperson Tommy Pigott:

Secretary of State Marco Rubio spoke with Kenyan President William Ruto to discuss bilateral cooperation and regional security issues.

Secretary Rubio thanked President Ruto for his public condemnation of Iranian aggression against Gulf States and discussed the objectives of Operation Epic Fury. He also expressed his gratitude for Kenya’s significant contributions to peace and security in Haiti and Kenya’s commitment to ensuring a smooth transition to the Gang Suppression Force.

The Secretary and President Ruto also discussed commercial opportunities and how to further strengthen our enduring partnership.